{"ts": 0.038627, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule · env\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.038699, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.038729, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv: variables and the prompt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nSix short lessons, then a task. This module stands alone and saves\r\nnothing. Everything stays inside this practice shell; your own setup\r\nfiles are not touched.\r\n\r\nAssumes the five stages, or that you know \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m, \u001b[92mcd\u001b[0m and \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for lesson 1.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 344}
{"ts": 0.042563, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(go on)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(this screen again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(back)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 159}
{"ts": 0.042851, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.042874, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
