{"ts": 0.229021, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.230417, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[93menv  gate\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 249}
{"ts": 0.230463, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.230484, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv — gate\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[36mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nFirst, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[36mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 202}
{"ts": 0.232606, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the question again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.232873, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.232889, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.236549, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   Which command makes a variable visible to the programs the shell\r\n", "len": 88}
{"ts": 0.236616, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export\n", "len": 7}
{"ts": 0.236647, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          starts?\r\nexport\r\n", "len": 39}
{"ts": 0.239664, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          set    export    env    echo\r\n", "len": 52}
{"ts": 0.239693, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.249335, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.252449, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What does \u001b[92mPATH\u001b[0m hold?\r\n", "len": 53}
{"ts": 0.252496, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "a list of folders\n", "len": 18}
{"ts": 0.25252, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "a list of folders\r\n", "len": 19}
{"ts": 0.255392, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          a list of folders    one folder    a file name\r\n", "len": 70}
{"ts": 0.255416, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.264535, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.267713, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 3 of 3   You type \u001b[92mPS1='me> '\u001b[0m, then \u001b[92mnext\u001b[0m. What is the prompt on the next\r\n", "len": 104}
{"ts": 0.267773, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "shelltutor>\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.2678, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          screen?\r\nshelltutor>\r\n", "len": 44}
{"ts": 0.27051, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          me>    shelltutor>\r\n", "len": 42}
{"ts": 0.270534, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 14}
{"ts": 0.270549, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.280715, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.291408, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.292813, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[93menv  task\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 249}
{"ts": 0.292848, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.292907, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nShow that a child program can see a variable you exported.\r\n", "len": 87}
{"ts": 0.292943, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  1. Set TOPIC to the word \u001b[1mshell\u001b[0m.\r\n  2. Export it.\r\n  3. Run a child with \u001b[92mbash -c\u001b[0m that prints \u001b[92m$TOPIC\u001b[0m into seen.txt.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mThis task runs in the module's own folder; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[90m shows it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Do the steps, then type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 283}
{"ts": 0.295531, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.295798, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.309115, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.309223, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\n", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.309247, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "TOPIC=shell\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 22}
{"ts": 0.309362, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.309387, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\n", "len": 13}
{"ts": 0.309409, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export TOPIC\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 23}
{"ts": 0.309484, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004h", "len": 8}
{"ts": 0.309496, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "shelltutor> ", "len": 12}
{"ts": 0.309518, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\n", "len": 33}
{"ts": 0.309567, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "bash -c 'echo $TOPIC' > seen.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 43}
{"ts": 0.316602, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.31665, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\n", "len": 6}
{"ts": 0.316672, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "check\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.340389, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.341528, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule · env\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.341564, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.341666, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv cleared.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nCommands and keys from this module:\r\n", "len": 64}
{"ts": 0.341703, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92mname=value    \u001b[0m \u001b[90mset a variable in this shell\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mexport name   \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlet child programs see it\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mecho \"$PATH\"  \u001b[0m \u001b[90mthe folders searched for programs\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92menv           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlist what children receive\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mPS1='$ '      \u001b[0m \u001b[90mchange the prompt (this shell only)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mSHELLTUTOR_HOME\u001b[0m \u001b[90mwhere this tutor puts your practice folder\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mquit\u001b[93m to leave, or \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to return to the start of this module.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 517}
{"ts": 0.344902, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(start this module again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(leave)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(this screen again)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 134}
{"ts": 0.345171, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
{"ts": 0.345187, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.357796, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
{"ts": 0.35788, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "quit\n", "len": 5}
{"ts": 0.3579, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "quit\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r", "len": 15}
{"ts": 0.360199, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.360365, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "Bye. A module saves nothing; run 'shelltutor env' to start it again.\r\n", "len": 70}
